TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Burada bu kadar farklı dükkân olunca{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}
sadece dolaşıp vitrinlere bakmak bile
keyifli. Uzaklardan gelmeye değer!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Shopping is so much more fun when
the atmosphere is lively.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That's why
I love shopping here.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ir de tiendas es mucho mejor en
este ambiente alegre y animado.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Por eso vengo siempre aquí!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Lo shopping è più divertente quando
l'ambiente è così vivace.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} È per
questo che adoooro fare spese qui.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Wenn die Einkaufsmeile belebt ist,
macht Einkaufen viel mehr Spaß.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} 
Darum komme ich so gerne her.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ortam hareketliyken alışveriş çok
daha eğlenceli oluyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} O yüzden
burada alışveriş yapmayı seviyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dükkân sahipleriyle ve senin gibi
arkadaşlarla sohbet etmeyi seviyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Ana Cadde’ye gelmek daha da keyifli oluyor.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}When you're reading a book,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} a quiet
place is best.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}But when you're out shopping,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
a lively place{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} is much more fun.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}No hay nada como un sitio tranquilo
para sentarse a leer un librito.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Eso sí,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} a la hora de ir de compras,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡cuanto más ajetreo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} mejor!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Per leggere un libro{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ci vuole
un posto tranquillo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ma per lo shopping,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} un posto allegro
e vivace{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} è senza dubbio l'ideale.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kitap okurken{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sessiz bir yer en iyisi.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}
Ama alışveriş yaparken{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} hareketli bir
ortam{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} çok daha eğlenceli.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Este lugar emana una energía
diferente y positiva por la noche.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡La percibo claramente!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich finde es faszinierend, wie fremd
die Gegend im Dunkeln wirkt.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tagsüber ist es hier ganz anders.
